        <li><a href="https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/31/colombia-awards-725-mw-of-solar-on-second-day-of-green-energy-auction/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Colombia awards 725 MW of solar on second day of green energy auction — PV Magazine</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/antora-energy-closes-us550-million-series-c-to-scale-us-thermal-battery-deployment/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Antora Energy closes US$550 million Series C to scale US thermal battery deployment — Energy Storage News</a></li>
